# Colony alert broadcast when Govfor starts or cancels an evacuation from the command tablet, during an Insurgency round to notify insurgents/colonists to start making their final moves.
govfor-evac-started = COLONY NOTICE: Military command is retreating and has initiated evacuation protocols for the Government Forces. Their departure will take place in { $minutes } minutes.
govfor-evac-cancelled = COLONY NOTICE: Military command has cancelled its evacuation protocol, the Government Forces are not departing and their operation will continue.
